{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"5ec2a2e8d06412ef06f5ede02f805611302b7be4afbed70c88385cce6a339f7a","ja":"お花見気分を味わうために","zh":"为了感受赏花的氛围","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"84e765a5f30778c6c5ea453b2f7627bef7d9b6482e467ea09a6b29430f679977","ja":"もう1回お花見ライブか～♪　しかも屋外ステージで\nなんて、すっげー楽しそうだよなっ！","zh":"已经办了1次赏花演出啦～♪　而且还是在\n室外舞台，听起来就超让人开心的啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0ffcd66c018bd5bed22ca6c8fef8a8bffeb705c9e329b0e0790e9ab7d57046b7","ja":"オレ、お客さん全員分のお弁当\n作っちゃおうかな～！","zh":"我要不要给所有的客人都\n做一份便当呢～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"4de107976172007bcf0a2520322e641edd4c5086aa9468a4368f4ec3300091f0","ja":"ええっ！？　ファンの人達は喜ぶだろうけど、\nみんなで協力しても、さすがにそれだけの量は……！","zh":"咦！？虽然粉丝们应该会很高兴，\n但就算大家一起齐心协力，这么大的量也实在太……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a3d40d444237c272acdc281e82766b7ac029b7c46817f1c978ec3973fa163b0c","ja":"そうですね……じゃあまたカラオケ大会を\n……って、それも規模的に無理ですね……。","zh":"也是呢……那再办一次卡拉OK大赛\n……不对，那个在规模上也行不通呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"2d81d701c9c702234292e98ee17d106f43d62f37c357e1eace79697962eb498c","ja":"じゃあ、ジェット噴射器で桜の花びらを\n撒くっていうのはどうかな！？","zh":"那用喷射器把樱花花瓣\n撒出去怎么样！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"516a5ec0d43342b6c6d4b512984d0f59317ecea2bc8dfe0fe88c07bac8e953c3","ja":"それならみんなで、\nお花見気分を味わえそうだよね？","zh":"这样的话，大家就能\n一起体会到赏花的气氛了吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"11057604487253da64369fe2bef7f0ff57301cb2d3685dc6ca3f56e2a05636f6","ja":"いや、それ用意するの大変じゃない！？\n後片付けもしなきゃいけないし。","zh":"不对，准备那个不是很费劲吗！？\n而且之后还得收拾。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"6cdd9d59dde8f8ead1881212df2846181b273d2d77995880fca195d02dfb01db","ja":"ご、ごめんなさい。\n無茶なこと提案しちゃって……うぅ。","zh":"对、对不起。\n提了这么乱来的建议……呜呜。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"dc534cd191e1d95243499a038312ce39cbda230684d41cb5b0e737ec05436a95","ja":"落ち込むことないって！\nもうちょっとみんなで考えてみようよ？","zh":"不用沮丧啦！\n大家再稍微想想看嘛？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"f613a3ce825d3ff8b7284f298112c121c9ef6421e0327797de701ff672e7b13e","ja":"えっと、客席も屋外なわけだから\nそれで何かできないかな……あ！　マス席！","zh":"那个，既然观众席也是室外的，\n能不能用这点来做些什么呢……啊！升席！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"0961cad79ceb5524e6e5cacc21d0b9c30bf4f8086367f5973be77c1e720b413e","ja":"マス席……？　ええと、それって……。","zh":"枡席……？　那个，那是……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"90eadb60ba25274fb0c9facce6962d814326923c0e8108e5d70de288ea0ef73f","ja":"プロレスの観客席をさ、数人で一緒に\n座れるマス席配置にすることがあるんだ！","zh":"摔跤比赛的观众席啊，有时会布置成\n能让好几个人坐在一起的方阵座席呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"02e5d254e944958796abbfcfa43735523ab9e23f6c2420fc51ebb9ee094cbdd2","ja":"そうやって座ると、なんだかお花見っぽく\nなりそうだな～って思って！","zh":"要是那样坐下来，总觉得就会\n变得很有赏花的气氛呢～我刚才就在想这个！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"a1b12eca2444505358c3ac38d39ca19b719d9a3e20fb87b6773cb6dc3a1ff570","ja":"あっ、野球にもそういう席あるよ！\n観戦すっげー楽しそうなんだよな～♪","zh":"啊，棒球比赛也有那种座位哦！\n感觉看比赛超开心的呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"3308027954c794abd8f2cdbfd244581452522911b068bb344193778c311d658e","ja":"へぇ、いいね！\nなんだか、いつもと違う楽しみ方ができそうだよ！","zh":"哎，不错呢！\n感觉能体验到和以往不同的乐趣呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1171.unity3d","item_key":"commands[59].text","source_sha256":"0b8f5c42649904507291f608bdb5af707689b4c62b3cc778e7d69dc3c396682e","ja":"うん♪　あと、他にも何か……あっ！\nあの、私もお花見っぽいこと、思いつきましたぁ～！","zh":"嗯♪ 还有其他什么……啊！\n那个，我也想到有赏花感觉的事了～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
